  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1100.html",
  "prefLabel": "Rev 1101.11 Fund",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-02-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1101.11 \"Fund\" means a fiscal and accounting entity with a self-balancing set of accounts recording cash and other financial resources, with all related liabilities and residual equities or balances, and changes therein, segregated for the purpose of carrying on specific activities or attaining certain objectives in accordance with special regulations, restrictions, or limitations.\n\nSource. #5072, eff 2-21-91, EXPIRED 2-21-97\n\nNew. #6476, eff 3-26-97; ss and moved by #8306, eff 3-22-05 (from Rev 1101.10); ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
